Applies the saved plan, refusing configuration changes since planning

Usage: leptoskit infra apply [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --app-target <NAME>  Select a named target from the root leptoskit.toml
      --offline            Recover infrastructure when the old primary is lost. Skips its application reservation; the provider state lock still applies
      --yes                Confirm the old primary and its deployment runners are stopped
  -h, --help               Print help
  -V, --version            Print version
